Death rays are useful, but not necessary.  I recommend to write 
scrolls of gold detection.  Additionally, have a look for taming 
scrolls, they are extremely useful.  Make sure you're expert on 
attack spells; magic missile and fireball/cone of cold can be 
quite helpful.  Of course, a great thing to have is a cursed 
scroll of genocide for some footrice-insta-help (provided you 
didn't genowipe them).  Just make sure no-one else wields a 
corpse, and you're fine.  Oh, and rings of conflict are useful, 
too.  

Polypiling is very unlikely to give you anything useful, hence 
I'd skip it altogether.  

